      },
      "id": 101,
      "options": {
        "content": "<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#c7ccd1\"><b style='color:#e6e9ed'>LLMB validation \u2014 area home.</b> This board owns the <b>job-attribution pipeline</b>: which trays are actually running the on-tray cgroup exporter that maps Slurm job steps to hardware. Everything else in this area depends on that mapping being complete, so any gap here invalidates the boards below it. Live counts and current run telemetry are owned by <b>Live Job &amp; GPU Telemetry</b>; per-run drill-downs by the two <b>Run Drill-Down</b> boards.<div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><a href=\"/d/iren_mkz-llmb-validation\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#20242b;border:1px solid #333a44;color:#9aa4b1;text-decoration:none\">Live Job &amp; GPU Telemetry</a><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#2a3f2a;border:1px solid #3d5a3d;color:#a8c8a8;font-weight:600\">LLMB Area Home</span><a href=\"/d/iren_mkz-llmb-deepseek\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#20242b;border:1px solid #333a44;color:#9aa4b1;text-decoration:none\">Run Drill-Down \u00b7 GPU Compute</a><a href=\"/d/iren_mkz-llmb-nemotron\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#20242b;border:1px solid #333a44;color:#9aa4b1;text-decoration:none\">Run Drill-Down \u00b7 Host &amp; Memory</a><a href=\"/d/nvis-l2-nccl-validation\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#20242b;border:1px solid #333a44;color:#9aa4b1;text-decoration:none\">NCCL Area Home</a><a href=\"/d/iren_mkz-nccl-validation\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#20242b;border:1px solid #333a44;color:#9aa4b1;text-decoration:none\">NCCL Runs \u00b7 NVLink &amp; Interconnect</a><a href=\"/d/iren_mkz-nccl-acceptance-matrix\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:3px;background:#20242b;border:1px solid #333a44;color:#9aa4b1;text-decoration:none\">Collective Run Coverage Matrix</a></div></div>",
        "mode": "html"
      },
